	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Vision OCR

Lightning-fast, 100% offline Optical Character Recognition (OCR) for Alfred, powered by Apple Vision Framework.

## Features
- **Clipboard-First**: Directly recognizes image data in your clipboard (copied from WeChat, CleanShot X, browser, etc.) in ~15ms with zero disk I/O.
- **Interactive Screen Capture Fallback**: If clipboard does not contain an image, automatically triggers interactive screen capture (screencapture -i).
- **100% Offline &amp; Private**: Uses macOS native Apple Vision framework. No cloud APIs, no network calls, zero data leaves your Mac.
- **Multi-language Out of the Box**: Supports English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.

## Usage
- Press Ctrl + F4 or type keyword ocr in Alfred:
  - If you already copied/snapped an image to clipboard, it recognizes it instantly and replaces clipboard with text.
  - If clipboard is empty or non-image, it opens crosshairs for you to select a screen area.
- Keyword ocr cap: Force interactive screen selection.
</string>
